I go to the checkout and I wait briefly.
I have the heavy coat, the grey sweatshirt and the yellow hat.
The shop assistant is very friendly.
"Hello," he says.
"Hello," I reply.
He scans the clothes.
"That comes to one hundred and eighty euros, please," he says.
I pay by card, because I do not have much cash.
"Do you need the receipt?" he asks.
"Yes, please," I say.
He gives me the receipt.
I take my large shopping bag.
I pack the thick sweatshirt into the bag.
But I do not pack the green coat.
I also keep the yellow hat.
I want to put the warm coat on right away.
"Have a nice day," the shop assistant says.
"Thank you, same to you," I reply.
